  ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit,.github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-28T20:16:34.913Z",local_mutation,fix/refuse-unattested-publish-fallback,Strict health verdict used by the sync workflow.
