close_reason: "Pilot verified: GitHub issue 50 was linked to existing item pm-graph-of5p, the atomic dry-run planned 0 creates and 1 update, the real import applied 0 creates and 1 update, duplicates remained at zero, YAML and shell checks passed, and npm run release:check plus ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit passed."
